x2 T1 [[Rare Weapons|Rares]] ([https://supremevalues.com Supreme])|theme=rare}}'''Spearmint''' is a {{C|Rare|rare}} knife that is currently obtainable by unboxing the [[2025 Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2025]]. It was also one of the weapons used to craft the [[Lights (Effect)|Lights]] effect.

== Appearance ==
The knife has a curved blade with alternating green and silver diagonal stripes running across both the blade and handle. The guard and the handle continue the striped pattern for a unified design.

== Trivia ==

* It has a [[Spearmint (Gun)|matching gun]] under the same name.
